      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carey%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Dorcas Carey Public Library serves as the village’s lending library, keeping books circulating among residents.",
